{"1725290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Vanguard", "steam_appid": 1725290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/73573090408d65e24d1b33a5be416aab.avif?t=1773218826\" width=780 height=1559 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule a Living Interstellar Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Vanguard</strong> is a real-time with pause 4X grand strategy where your empire is alive, reactive, and fragile. Expansion is only the beginning, your success depends on managing people, resources, and fleets across vast distances, while every choice can strengthen your civilization or expose it to collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the Fate of Your People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/6f01235a303ef90161d8ef87207a6710.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/6f01235a303ef90161d8ef87207a6710.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/6f01235a303ef90161d8ef87207a6710.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your citizens are active participants in your empire, not static numbers. They migrate toward opportunity, flee conflict, resettle new colonies, and become refugees, directly affecting planetary productivity, stability, and growth. Every policy and action you take shapes how your population lives, moves, and survives across the galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim New Worlds and Make Them Thrive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/1411da880f21f4c0a62878d3253afa09.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/1411da880f21f4c0a62878d3253afa09.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/1411da880f21f4c0a62878d3253afa09.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push into uncharted space and establish colonies across diverse star systems. Develop infrastructure, extract resources, and build industrial capacity while integrating each new world into a larger imperial network. Each colony strengthens your reach but increases the complexity and responsibility of empire management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Project Power and Wage Galactic War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/db0dd4ec08d2ee3d050e2bf14ee49b82.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/db0dd4ec08d2ee3d050e2bf14ee49b82.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/db0dd4ec08d2ee3d050e2bf14ee49b82.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military strength allows you to defend your empire or impose your will on others. Design custom ship classes with modular weapons, armor, and hardpoints, and deploy fleets across the galaxy to achieve strategic objectives. Victory depends on preparation, positioning, and supply as much as raw firepower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover, Adapt, and Advance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/23776084c9d3a0ff65e76bacc725388f.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/23776084c9d3a0ff65e76bacc725388f.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/23776084c9d3a0ff65e76bacc725388f.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the galaxy, uncover mysteries, and expand scientific knowledge. Invest in engineering programs to unlock new technologies that enhance your economy, infrastructure, and military. Your discoveries influence how your empire grows, defends itself, and responds to escalating challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold an Empire Together Across the Stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/7a3fe47ffea14ff0ba389e3784f1f0da.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/7a3fe47ffea14ff0ba389e3784f1f0da.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/7a3fe47ffea14ff0ba389e3784f1f0da.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empire survives only if its systems and supply networks function. Planets depend on resources to grow, and fleets need logistical support to remain operational. Poor planning or overextension can destabilize entire regions, forcing critical strategic decisions that test your empire’s resilience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule at Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/e968fa05dc04b889ab8ef94f82ec8d90.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/e968fa05dc04b889ab8ef94f82ec8d90.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/e968fa05dc04b889ab8ef94f82ec8d90.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how closely you want to manage your empire. Automate administrative tasks to focus on high-level strategy, or take direct control of production, logistics, and development across individual systems. Final Vanguard allows you to scale the depth of your experience to match your preferred style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow Final Vanguard</strong> to receive development updates, feature reveals, and progress toward release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/8e06efb9473953b1eede6340bb9e68f1.webp?t=1773218826\" width=1560 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Final Vanguard is in development. All screenshots and footage represent alpha gameplay. Visuals, mechanics, and systems are subject to change.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule a Living Interstellar Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.webm?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/dc4ee59e0bd6882d0d3ec7475f53b173.mp4?t=1773218826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Vanguard</strong> is a real-time with pause 4X grand strategy where your empire is alive, reactive, and fragile. Expansion is only the beginning, your success depends on managing people, resources, and fleets across vast distances, while every choice can strengthen your civilization or expose it to collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the Fate of Your People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/6f01235a303ef90161d8ef87207a6710.poster.avif?t=1773218826\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/