al Vanguard</strong> to receive development updates, feature reveals, and progress toward release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/extras/8e06efb9473953b1eede6340bb9e68f1.webp?t=1773218826\" width=1560 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Final Vanguard is in development. All screenshots and footage represent alpha gameplay. Visuals, mechanics, and systems are subject to change.</i></p>", "short_description": "Rule a living interstellar empire in this real-time 4X grand strategy. Make decisions that shape civilian lives, manage fragile supply lines, lead military conquests, and decide whether your civilization thrives or collapses under its own expansion.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/fe0e053d2068c4f121065768908ed342d96a1104/header.jpg?t=1773218826", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/27594f11bb26dc16c2292fe5291b33e88d787ef7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773218826", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725290/27594f11bb26dc16c2292fe5291b33e88d787ef7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773218826", "website": "https://www.finalvanguard.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li>